<h1>I&D Hub – User Manual (English)</h1>
<p><strong>Version:</strong> v2.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 2026</p>

<h2>1. Overview</h2>
<p>I&D Hub is the Innovation & Development Project Management System. URL: https://frontend-alpha-bay-74.vercel.app/</p>

<h3>Roles</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Role</th><th>Access</th></tr>
<tr><td>Superadmin</td><td>Full system access: approvals, AI analysis, settings, all users</td></tr>
<tr><td>Admin</td><td>Projects + AI analysis (view/analyse; no approvals/settings)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Project User</td><td>View/update own project only</td></tr>
<tr><td>Guest</td><td>Browse projects, submit idea, view funding schemes</td></tr>
</table>

