<h2>3. Login & Account</h2>
<h3>Login</h3>
<p>Admin/Superadmin: Admin Login tab → email + password → Login.</p>
<p>Project User: Project Login tab → Project ID + password.</p>
<p>Guest: click Guest button.</p>
<h3>Forgot Password</h3>
<p>Forgot Password? → enter email → Send Reset Link → follow email link.</p>
<h3>Change Password</h3>
<p>Change Password → email + current password + new password (min 6) + confirm.</p>

<h2>4. Superadmin – Key Functions</h2>
<h3>Dashboard</h3>
<p>6 KPIs (Total/In Progress/Planning/Completed/Due Soon/At Risk), health doughnut chart, upcoming/overdue list, recent ideas.</p>
<h3>Pending Approval (core)</h3>
<p>Four sections: Pending / Approved / Rejected / Deleted.</p>
<p>AI Analyze → choose provider (OpenAI / Custom / Cloudflare – default @cf/deepseek-ai/deepseek-r1-distill-qwen-32b) → Run Analysis. Result shows 7-dimension scorecard, overall score, recommendation, full report, "For reference only." Export Word downloads .doc.</p>
<p>With existing report: AI Report (view) / Export Word / Re-Analyze (regenerate).</p>
<p>Approve → auto-creates project (IDNDYYMMNNN). Reject → reason required. 🗑️ soft delete → Deleted. Restore → back to Pending. Permanently Delete (⚠️ irreversible).</p>
<h3>Submit Idea</h3>
<p>8-step wizard: Applicant Info → Project Details → Timeline → Budget → Resources → Technical → Current Stage → IP & Attachments.</p>
<h3>Funding Schemes</h3>
<p>Add/Edit/Delete schemes (name*, provider*, amount, description, eligibility, deadline, status).</p>
<h3>Settings</h3>
<p>Overdue/Budget thresholds, Email notifications, Alert colors, AI Report Prompt, Backup & Restore, Project Credentials.</p>
<h3>Alerts / Report Export</h3>
<p>Alerts: critical/warning/info. Export Excel: Projects / Ideas / Funding / All-in-one.</p>

<h2>5. Admin</h2>
<p>Dashboard / All Projects / My Projects: same as Superadmin.</p>
<p>Pending Approval: can AI Analyze, view AI Report, Export Word. Cannot approve/reject, Re-Analyze, delete/restore.</p>
<p>Funding Schemes: browse only.</p>

<h2>6. Project User</h2>
<p>Login with Project ID + password → My Project page. View overview, stages, activity log. Edit basic fields → Save (logged).</p>

<h2>7. Guest</h2>
<p>Browse All Projects, Submit Idea, view Funding Schemes only.</p>

<h2>8. FAQ (Summary)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Issue</th><th>Solution</th></tr>
<tr><td>Forgot password</td><td>Admin Login → Forgot Password? → email link</td></tr>
<tr><td>AI "Failed to fetch"</td><td>Check network / local endpoint / backend port 5000 / try another provider</td></tr>
<tr><td>AI invalid format</td><td>Re-run or use DeepSeek model</td></tr>
<tr><td>Admin approve?</td><td>No – Superadmin only</td></tr>
<tr><td>No Full Report</td><td>AI must output "report" key; try DeepSeek / Re-Analyze</td></tr>
<tr><td>Modal closes outside?</td><td>No – use ✕ or Cancel</td></tr>
<tr><td>Export Word later?</td><td>Open AI Report → Export Word anytime</td></tr>
</table>

